<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=861&lastnode_id=175">Rana</a> on 2001-08-03 20:15:56</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2>Sorry to do this all, but VI has pissed me off to the point were I can no longer stay with EQ.  It has become more of a stressor then a stress relief.  As of tonight (Fri Aug 3rd 2001) VI has made it so that I can no longer get into EQ to play.  They have made some patch or something that has forced my system to have hard memory dumps every time I try to log in.  I was able to play yesterday (and up to today) with only minor issues that I could live with, but today I have not been able to get into the game without EQ causing my system to reboot.<br>
<br>
I sent VI a nasty little e-mail with a request to cancel my account.  I do not expect VI to get to it over the weekend, but I will not be back after tomorrow morning.  I will be willing to log in Rana and the other 7 chars that I have on TT server and donate all of my equipment and PP to the BH as long as it is given to those who need it for free and without points.<br>
<br>
I will not be able to log in long tomorrow morning for I will have to teach classes.<br>
<br>
My choice is not an easy one to make.  I have been playing (addicted to EQ) since beta 4.  I love the game, and for the most part the ppl who play the game too.  VI has just pushed me to the point of no return.  Everything that VI has done over the last year has been nothing but a big bunch of BULLSHIT and I can no longer play something that is upsetting me so much.<br>
<br>
The BLOODHORDE is a great guild and a fun family of players.  Please keep up the great EVIL work and the awesome RPing.  <br>
<br>
Rana<br>
36th Ogre Warrior <br>
BLOODHORDE<br>
