<font color=white><A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=2106&lastnode_id=175">The Efreeti Run, Sunday Aug5th 1pm EST</a> (1 Replies)</font></td>
<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=1639&lastnode_id=175">Pustule</a> on 2001-08-01 21:53:10</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2>Greetings to the Horde,<br>
<br>
-ooc-<br>
<br>
In an effort to get some better eq for our casters and meleers, Kementari and I are organizing a trip down to Lord Djarn's place this Sunday, August 5th, at 1pm EST.  Keeping this short and sweet, heres a few things to know:<br>
<br>
-Meet at Lavastorm zonein<br>
-Minimum level restriction should be 45.  Mobs we will be fighting range from 44-48, with Djarn being lv50.<br>
-Loot Rules: Int/Wis casters will be rolling on any GEBS (ac5 int9/wis9), Meleers will roll on any Rings (agi9 hp80)<br>
-Djarn is a 24min spawn, and appears approx 30% of the time.  Once we get to him it should be an easy camp, but be prepared to spend alot of time there so that we can get as much loot as we can.<br>
<br>
After the failed Naggy raid last saturday, we decided to try the Lord but the imps were too tough.  Since then ive been researching strats on how to accomplish it, and I think we can do it now.  The key to getting there is speed and FD splitting:  The imps are on a 24 min timer so we need to FD pull them and keep moving, otherwise we run the risk of getting respawns behind us halfway to the Lord.  Be prepared to keep on your toes as we'll be racing against the clock once we start pulling imps.<br>
<br>
On another note, Kitzu and I are currently trying to organize another joint BH/SU event.  This time the target will be the Kael Arena.  Because its not a planar zone, we will be able to have it during the weekend if this is better for the majority of our members.  Look for more info about it sometime next week.<br>
RRARRRRRR<br>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor=#333333>
