<font color=white><A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=2101&lastnode_id=175">Scarlet Underground Hate Raid!</a> (0 Replies)</font></td>
<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=275&lastnode_id=175">Kementari</a> on 2001-07-30 06:02:01</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2>The Hate raid went rather well after some bugs were ironed out.  We cleared the entire first floor besides the Maestro. (He did clear us once on a bad pull though.) The <B><font color=red> Bloodhorde </font color=red> </b>made an awesome showing with <b>Darakryn, Azhrarn, Freyja, Kiarha, Vanc, Harkkonen, Gaki, Kaelas, Lazier, Ozzwald, Thul, Ulul, Boilybut, Pustule and little old me showing up.</b><br>
<br>
After one set of cleric arms rotted everyone pre-rolled by class for items.<br>
<b><br>
Darakryn got Ethereal Mist greaves<br>
Freyja got an Ethereal Mist bracer<br>
<br>
Boilybut got Indicolite greaves.<br>
<br>
Harkkonen got the decrepit hide for his epic quest<br>
<br>
I got a Woven Shadow bracer and got to run around Hate trying to find bodies for the first time.<font color=red> Muh Hahahahahahahaha! </font color=red> <br>
</b><br>
At the end of the raid after all the costs of peridots and port stones were reimbursed, Scarlet Underground was extremely generous and randomed the plane gems received to the people who had received nothing during the raid.<br>
<br>
I know Ozzwald and Azhrarn both got blue diamonds  and I think we had some other people get a few gems too, but I missed writing them down.  I also might have missed or messed up some of the armor drops,  so please append them on this message if I did.<br>
<br>
The big thing we need to remember for next time is to get a supply of shrink potions for our large tanks.  There was not a single shaman on the raid and it got very hard to target we were able to get some of them into wolf form and that helped some.  <br>
<br>
After the one Maestro wipe-out there was a bit of a mass exodus  and things actually went faster and smoother after people left because of the targetting problems.  <br>
<br>
I want to thank Pustule for all her work getting us involved on this raid and the hard work of doing all the port ups alone! (I'm still dead sexier though! lol)<br>
<br>
I had a great time it was nice meeting the other people  and meeting fellow Horde members I've never got to really see since I have a habit on being on the wrong side of the world for all the fun stuff.<br>
<br>
<font color=red><b> Kementari Zha'linth<br>
Bloodknight and pickpocketer of Voness' dagger</b></font color=red> </td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr>
